Z||000001||stimpy||11-07-2000||09:45 AM||||AAAARRRRGGGGHHHHH!!!!!!!<BR>DON'T DO IT! FOR THE LOVE OF PETE, DON'T DO IT!<P>There are plenty of winged decks out there, as the majority of GT's were burdened with a wing. Get a new decklid thats already been violated to put the blasphemy on, and sell your virginal deck to someone who appreciates the clean, timless lines of a wingless GT.  Or just save it until you outgrow the boy-racer phase that mandates a drag-producing chunk of fiberglass on your back deck.<P>------------------<BR>Loud Pipes Save Lives!       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stimpy_sig.gif">  <BR><p>[This message has been edited by stimpy (edited 11-07-2000).]||||reg||1
