Z||000009||stimpy||11-08-2000||01:01 AM||||Naw, go to town.  I think coupes without wings are pretty common.  But the notchback GT is pretty uncommon to find without a wing, and they just loo so darn pretty.  Besides, if someone did have a "problem", so what? The Fiero police are severely underpaid and are too busy busting the people with one headlight up to mess with what you do with your car.||||reg||1
